# Plan the Heist: "Surveil 3 if you have no cards in hand. Then draw three cards." Bot1 casts five Moxen and Black Lotus, so the Heist
# is the only card in hand, and casting it empties the hand. It surveils 3 first: Lightning Bolt goes to the graveyard and Counterspell
# and Island stay on top in that order, so the three cards drawn are Counterspell, Island and Ornithopter (the surveil came before
# the draw, and only three were looked at: Memnite is drawn by nothing).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Black Lotus
Plan the Heist
Lightning Bolt
Counterspell
Island
Ornithopter
Memnite
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

